data: {""p"":""/message/content/parts/0"",""o"":""append"",""v"":""In India, **most adults can""} 

event: delta
data: {""v"":"" apply for a credit card**, but""} 

event: delta
data: {""v"":"" approval depends on the bank""}   

event: delta
data: {""v"":""/card issuer.\n\n### Typical eligibility\n\n- **Age:** Usually **18+** (some cards require 21+).\n- **Income:** You generally need a regular""}    

event: delta
data: {""v"":"" income; the minimum varies by card.\n- **Employment/business:** Salaried employees, self-employed people""}       

event: delta
data: {""v"":"", and business owners can apply for suitable cards.\n- **Credit history:** A good CIBIL/credit score helps, but **you can""}       

event: delta
data: {""v"":"" get a card without a credit history**.\n- **KYC:** Usually""}     

event: delta
data: {""v"":"" PAN and valid identity/address documents are required.\n- **Repayment capacity:** The issuer considers your income, existing loans,""}    

event: delta
data: {""v"":"" credit utilisation, and other obligations.\n\n### If you have no credit score\n\nYou can consider an **FD-backed secured""}       

event: delta
data: {""v"":"" credit card**. Because the card is secured against your fixed deposit, it can be easier to get than""}    

event: delta
data: {""v"":"" a regular unsecured card.\n\n### If your score is around 700\n\nYou""}    

event: delta
data: {""v"":"" can still be eligible for many cards, although a **750+ score** generally gives you more options and potentially""}       

event: delta
data: {""v"":"" better offers.\n\nIf you tell me your **age, monthly income, and CIBIL score**, I can suggest the""}      

event: delta
data: {""p"":"""",""o"":""patch"",""v"":[{""p"":""/message/content/parts/0"",""o"":""append"",""v"":"" types of credit cards you're most likely to qualify for in India.""},{""p"":""/message/status"",""o"":""replace"",""v"":""finished_successfully""},{""p"":""/message/end_turn"",""o"":""replace"",""v"":true},{""p"":""/message/metadata"",""o"":""append"",""v"":{""search_result_groups"":[],""finish_details"":{""type"":""stop"",""stop_tokens"":[200002]},""is_complete"":true,""can_save"":true}}]}  

